Smart AI Chatbot 🤖

A simple Rule-Based AI Chatbot built using Python that responds to user queries using a predefined dictionary of answers. This project demonstrates the use of Python fundamentals such as dictionaries, functions, loops, conditional statements, and string handling to create an interactive chatbot experience.

✨ Features
Responds to greetings and basic conversations
Answers programming and technology-related questions
Includes jokes, facts, and motivational replies
Uses dictionary-based response matching
Beginner-friendly Python project
Continuous chat until user types bye
🛠️ Technologies Used
Python
Dictionaries
Functions
Loops
Conditional Statements
String Handling
📂 How It Works

The chatbot stores predefined questions and answers inside a Python dictionary.
When the user enters a question, the chatbot searches for matching keywords and returns the related response.

▶️ How to Run
Install Python on your system
Copy the code into a .py file
Run the file using:
python chatbot.py
